    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-2-nprop-005",
      "segment_id": "2",
      "text": "一旦有人试图篡改数据，其他参与者就能通过“少数服从多数”的原则，判断出哪一份账本是真实的。",
      "span": {
        "start": 68,
        "end": 113,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-006",
        "lesson-002-kprop-007"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0012"
      ],
      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-3-nprop-006",
      "segment_id": "3",
      "text": "区块链采用链式数据结构，由多个区块组成。",
      "span": {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 20,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-008"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0012"
      ],
      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-3-nprop-007",
      "segment_id": "3",
      "text": "每个区块既包括上一个区块的哈希散列和随机数等基础信息，也包括交易执行记录。",
      "span": {
        "start": 20,
        "end": 57,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-009"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0012"
      ],
      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-3-nprop-008",
      "segment_id": "3",
      "text": "哈希函数可以依据输入数据创建一个简短的哈希散列值。",
      "span": {
        "start": 57,
        "end": 82,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-010"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0013"
      ],
      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-3-nprop-009",
      "segment_id": "3",
      "text": "输入数据即使发生微小变动，也会导致哈希输出发生显著变化",
      "span": {
        "start": 82,
        "end": 109,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-011"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0013"
      ],
      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-3-nprop-010",
      "segment_id": "3",
      "text": "因此哈希值可以帮助检验数据是否曾被篡改。",
      "span": {
        "start": 110,
        "end": 130,
        "unit": "unicode_codepoint",
        "end_exclusive": true
      },
      "knowledge_proposition_ids": [
        "lesson-002-kprop-012"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "raw-unit-0013"
