      "status": "LLM_PROPOSED_NARRATION_GROUNDING_PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW"
    },
    {
      "id": "lesson-002-seg-5-nprop-014",
      "segment_id": "5",
      "text": "也就是说，你无法从哈希值反推原始数据。",
